# Cloudflare Pages redirects. First match wins.
#
# Purpose: carry every URL Google already has indexed on the old site over to
# the new one with a 301, so ranking signals transfer instead of hitting a 404.

# --- Apex to www -----------------------------------------------------------
# The old site canonicalised to www and that is what is indexed, so www stays
# the primary hostname. Without this both hosts serve 200 and split signals.
https://fastexmedia.com/*  https://www.fastexmedia.com/:splat  301

# --- Old blog ---------------------------------------------------------------
# These three posts are indexed. Until the blog is ported, send each to the
# closest matching page rather than dropping them.
# REMOVE these lines once the blog exists at /blog/ again.
/blog/whatsapp-marketing-for-b2b-guide  /services/whatsapp-marketing/  301
/blog/cold-email-vs-linkedin-outreach   /services/email-marketing/     301
/blog/b2b-lead-generation-strategies    /services/                     301
/blog/                                  /services/                     301
/blog                                   /services/                     301

